; A StandardMaterial3D with billboard_mode = ENABLED on a QuadMesh: the quad must
; turn to FACE the camera. The golden frames it from the editor's isometric angle,
; where a non-billboarded +Z quad would foreshorten to a thin sliver — so if
; billboarding ever regresses, the asymmetric walk sprite collapses and the golden
; fails. A second quad (billboard_mode = DISABLED) sits beside it as the fixed
; reference that SHOULD foreshorten.
[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3]

